Band Visual & Press Photoshoot Prompt: Four masked figures in meticulously frayed, sun-bleached robes interwoven with exposed circuit boards and gleaming chrome shards, standing dramatically on a windswept sand dune against a blazing orange sunset. One figure plays a brutalist slide-guitar fashioned from rusted street signs, another is hunched over a chaotic console of blinking 1980s synth pads and custom drum machines, cables snaking like metallic vines. The scene is bathed in an intense, warm glow, with shimmering heat haze distorting the distant, ruined city skyline, suggesting both desolate beauty and frantic innovation.

Mood/Vibe: Ecstatic desolation, sun-baked chaos, vibrant yearning for a forgotten tropical future.

